# Bilpark · Cursor Development Rules

Rules for anyone (Cursor, Claude, a developer) changing Bilpark or DriverControl. They force one way of building. `CLAUDE.md` in the app repository remains binding for app code; these rules add the design-system and operational-model rules on top. Where the two seem to conflict, stop and ask.

